1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
Could Bolt land on a cloud?

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,220
It looks solid enough.

3
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,340
He hits the top…

4
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,440
…and falls right through.

5
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,000
Inside, he's soaked…

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,300
…cold, and blind.

7
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,940
But this cloud weighs a million pounds.

8
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,440
So why can't it hold him?

9
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:16,520
A cloud is just fog — too thin to hold anything, so he falls right through.

10
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:19,060
So… could you ever land on a cloud?

